  "error": "SimDeadlock: lanes still blocked:\n  the four calls are producer `lock` (take a slot) / `ready` (publish) and consumer `wait` (acquire) / `free` (return the credit); `ready` of cycle i orders `wait` of cycle i, while `lock` of cycle i blocks on `free` of cycle i-depth. A count that never moves names the call that is missing: no consumer `free` stalls `lock`, no producer `ready` stalls `wait`, and a `ready` published more often than it is waited for leaves a token no reader consumes.\n  see library/docs/api/synchronization.md#cross-side-ownership",
